ents so he's a great eye  for this stuff  my producer kenny hid the five different  displays and hooked them up to the new  mac studio desktop which had test files  including 4k videos yes the top gun  trailer and some professional color test  tools  the studio display by the way works with  any newer mac not just this new desktop  yeah the whites look pretty good  grays look pretty good dan and i both  evaluated them on our own so not to  influence each other  out of them all dan liked both the lg  displays the best  specifically the more expensive one all  the first three so far this one seems  pretty good you know there's good detail  there's no clipping there's no crushing  i liked the apple studio and the 5k lg  the best and really struggled to tell  the difference between them  i mean honestly if you told me that this  display and the last one were the same i  kind of would believe you maybe the like  coloring here is a little bit yellower  i need to look at these two side by side  we both noticed a yellowish tint on the  apple display but when we turned off  true tone apple's automatic adjustment  feature any noticeable color  irregularity was gone oh that's it it's  much less yellow it still looks  different but i think the lg is almost  like a touch cooler and you know  honestly like between these two they're  they're pretty excellent looking  monitors so yeah tie on display quality  number two webcam quality  sitting at the top of apple's display is  a 12 megapixel camera but how is the  image quality  not good actually bad  let's take a look here's the apple  studio display in my well-lit home  office  grainy  now look at it compared to the  front-facing camera on the iphone 11 pro  which has the same a13 processor and  camera  even the 14-inch macbook pro and the 5k  lg monitors webcam looked better  same situation in the studio oof  it just consistently produced grainy and  washed out images even in good lighting  an apple spokeswoman told me we  discovered an issue where the system is  not behaving as expected we'll be making  improvements in a future software update  but here's the coolest feature it's  called center stage and as i move around  the webcam moves around and it pans to  wherever i go this is very fun  you get me down here  number three speaker quality  there are six speakers in the display  and boy are they good  now for the spatial audio test where i  play music that we don't have the rights  to so you won't be able to listen to it  yes the a13 chip also enables spatial  audio a virtual surround sound  experience  either way these speakers crushed every  other monitor's built-in speakers in my  side-by-side tests  number four  other things  finally a monitor isn't just a monitor  anymore if you have a laptop it's a  docking station the studio has this one  thunderbolt port capable of fast  charging a laptop and then three other  usbc ports that can be used as a hub for  your other gear so you don't always have  to plug them into your laptop  the 5k lg has a similar selection of  ports  my own 4k lg has a selection of older  ports but you know what both of those  lg's have adjustable stands  the studio display requires you pay an  extra 400 for a height adjustment stand  or you know you could just pull this pro  move  so what do you do well if you don't care  about speaker quality or an attractive  aluminum design save the 300 and get the  5k lg but here's some bad news the lg is  sold out now at various retailers but an  lg spokesman told me that it's still an  active product he expects it to be back  in stock in early april  but honestly i wasn't blown away enough  to buy either of these 5k monitors  maybe that will change with this webcam  software update but right now apple's  perks aren't good enough to make me give  up my trusty 450 lg 4k display which let  me remind you does this  better look next time in monitor madness  apple

